{"unit_id":"appthin__dsh-rea-agents#card-zh","repo":"appthin/dsh-rea-agents","commit":"5956dc953840063189713689ece0fe4bf9a476d6","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-rea-agents 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的 REA 管理插件，在插件卡片上提供版本与安装状态面板，并通过 MCP stdio 启动配置档内固定版本的 rea-agents。它可检查 registry 最新版本、将指定版本精确安装或原地更新、卸载固定副本并刷新磁盘状态，也会显示当前版本、配置档声明和 Node 版本。适合需要在 DSH 中管理 REA 逆向分析工具连接的用户；分析引擎由用户自行准备，安装更新需本机 Node.js 与 pnpm。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:785-813","lib/index.js:413-496","lib/index.js:655-735","cordis.patch.yml:48-60"]}
{"unit_id":"appthin__dsh-rea-agents#card-en","repo":"appthin/dsh-rea-agents","commit":"5956dc953840063189713689ece0fe4bf9a476d6","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-rea-agents manages a pinned REA MCP server for DSH Web. Its plugin card shows versions and lets users install, update, refresh, or remove the profile copy. The launcher resolves the package from that profile. Users provide analysis engines; installation and updates need Node.js and pnpm.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:785-813","lib/index.js:413-496","lib/index.js:655-735","cordis.patch.yml:48-60"]}
